TextMate Grammar Files — Third-Party Notices
=============================================

All `*.tmLanguage.json` files in this directory are vendor copies of upstream
TextMate grammar files. Each grammar is licensed under MIT (or equivalent
permissive licenses) by its respective contributors. Files are unmodified
from their upstream sources.

