ALIAS DECISIONS
===============

  - `objective-c` / `objc` / `obj-c` aliases route to the C grammar for now;
    a dedicated Objective-C TextMate grammar can be added later if needed.
  - `console` and `shell-session` aliases route to the bash grammar.

